  NameBox: {fileID: 1804240662}
  DialogueText: {fileID: 183528106}
  NameText: {fileID: 36906199}
  DialogueLines:
  - "It\u2019s cold at night with no blankets to spare."
  - We are so hungry, and with no food available, my family will surely die before
    the season ends.
  - Miss, your warmth is great. This will certainly help my family. Thank you.
  NPCName: Peter
  TypeSpeed: 0.05
  _LineDelay: 2
  _EndDelay: 7
  height: 2
